{"lines": ["How is King Henry the Seventh connected to Lamine Yamal?", "Henry the Seventh's throne passed down for four centuries to Queen Elizabeth the Second.", "In twenty nineteen, the Queen marked D-Day's 75th anniversary beside Donald Trump.", "A year earlier, Trump had hosted Spain's prime minister, Pedro S\u00e1nchez, in New York.", "And in twenty twenty-four, S\u00e1nchez welcomed Lamine Yamal and Spain's Euro champions in Madrid.", "How is Donald Trump connected to Julius Caesar?", "In May twenty seventeen, President Donald Trump visited Pope Francis at the Vatican.", "Francis was the 266th pope, in an unbroken line of popes running back to Saint Peter.", "Around fourteen eighty-two, Filippino Lippi painted Saint Peter on trial before the Roman emperor Nero.", "And Nero was the last emperor of the dynasty that began with Julius Caesar and his heir Augustus.", "How is Nelson Mandela connected to Napoleon?", "In two thousand five, Nelson Mandela visited George W Bush in the Oval Office.", "In two thousand six, Bush dropped in on Gerald Ford at his home in Rancho Mirage, California.", "In nineteen seventy-three, Richard Nixon picked Ford as his vice president; a year later Ford had his job.", "In nineteen seventy, Nixon threw a White House dinner for Edward the Eighth, the king who gave up his throne.", "Back in eighteen ninety-four, baby Edward sat on the lap of his great-grandmother, Queen Victoria.", "This painting shows Victoria in eighteen fifty-five, visiting Napoleon's tomb in Paris with Emperor Napoleon the Third.", "And in this eighteen ten painting, the baby on Napoleon's knee is his nephew, the future Napoleon the Third.", "How is Zeus connected to Luffy from One Piece?", "Around sixteen twenty-two, Rubens painted Jupiter, the Roman Zeus, lifting King Henry the Fourth of France into heaven.", "From Henry the Fourth, the line of French rulers runs through kings, emperors and presidents to Emmanuel Macron.", "In twenty eighteen, Macron shook hands with Vladimir Putin in Saint Petersburg.", "Back in twenty fifteen, Putin met Barack Obama at the United Nations in New York.", "In twenty ten, Obama filmed a MythBusters episode at the White House with Adam Savage.", "In twenty twelve, Savage shared a Comic-Con stage with fellow MythBuster Grant Imahara.", "In twenty thirteen, Imahara posed at Phoenix Comicon with actor Chris, son of the original Star Trek's Scotty.", "In twenty fifteen, Chris sat on a Phoenix Comicon panel next to voice actor Todd Haberkorn.", "In twenty eleven, Haberkorn signed autographs at New York Comic Con with fellow Fairy Tail voice actor Colleen Clinkenbeard.", "And Clinkenbeard is the English voice of Luffy, the hero of One Piece.", "How is Augustus connected to Tom Cruise?", "Augustus was Rome's first emperor, and his family dynasty ended four emperors later with Nero.", "From Peter, the line of popes runs unbroken to the 264th, John Paul the Second.", "In nineteen eighty-seven, Nancy Reagan joined John Paul the Second at a Los Angeles school during his American tour.", "And in nineteen eighty-five, Nancy hosted Tom Cruise at the White House, honored by a school for students with dyslexia."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.38], ["is", 0.38, 0.6], ["King", 0.6, 0.78], ["Henry", 0.78, 1.2], ["VII", 1.2, 1.7], ["connected", 1.7, 2.2], ["to", 2.2, 2.54], ["Lamina", 2.54, 2.92], ["Mall?", 2.92, 3.34], ["Henry", 3.98, 4.34], ["VII's", 4.34, 4.88], ["throne", 4.88, 5.12], ["passed", 5.12, 5.4], ["down", 5.4, 5.76], ["for", 5.76, 5.96], ["four", 5.96, 6.24], ["centuries", 6.24, 6.7], ["to", 6.7, 7.02], ["Queen", 7.02, 7.26], ["Elizabeth", 7.26, 7.52], ["II.", 7.52, 8.16], ["In", 8.6, 8.8], ["2019,", 8.8, 9.24], ["the", 9.78, 9.9], ["Queen", 9.9, 10.06], ["marked", 10.06, 10.38], ["D", 10.38, 10.62], ["-Day's", 10.62, 10.98], ["75th", 10.98, 11.58], ["anniversary", 11.58, 11.84], ["beside", 11.84, 12.42], ["Donald", 12.42, 12.78], ["Trump.", 12.78, 13.1], ["A", 13.58, 13.72], ["year", 13.72, 13.88], ["ear